{"id":"wb-7-89","name":"高丽城山城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"高丽城山城","text":"高丽城山城又称青石岭山城，位于中华人民共和国辽宁省营口市盖州市青石岭镇高丽城村，是约五世纪初由高句丽所建的山城遗址。该遗址于2013年被列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%BD%E5%9F%8E%E5%B1%B1%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":93046735,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93046735","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}